% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% queries.clausal -- QUERY-COMBINATOR layer for eu/dora_rts_simplified_testing_continuity_and_report.
% A TOP-LAYER consumer: it imports the determination slice's PUBLIC
% predicates it calls, and nothing else.
%
% dora_rts_simplified_testing_continuity_and_report_profile_keys/1:
%     the forty-two profile keys, in root_exports (input_contract) order.
% dora_rts_simplified_testing_continuity_and_report_input_problems/2:
%     the order's input check, re-exported from the kernel as the scaffold wrote it.
% dora_rts_simplified_testing_continuity_and_report_what_if/4 (#16 what-if):
%     one key set to a new value (replacing every attribute of that key), the
%     complete query re-run, the name of its RESULT returned.
% dora_rts_simplified_testing_continuity_and_report_compliance_check/3 (#13):
%     is the proposed action omit(DUTY) allowed for this entity?
%       prohibited           -- the duty applies (once the gate holds, every
%                               condition holds), whatever its key says;
%       permitted            -- the gate is false, or a false trigger defeats
%                               the duty (the deontic defeater);
%       indeterminate([KEY]) -- KEY the gate, or the first absent condition of
%                               the duty in its condition order;
%       input_problems(P)    -- a malformed profile (THE INPUT CHECK first).
% The eligibility verdict (#2) and the cited checklist (#7) are the slice's
% decide_dora_rts_simplified_testing_continuity_and_report/2 and
% dora_rts_simplified_testing_continuity_and_report_checklist/2; the compliance
% check reads that checklist, so it never decides a duty twice.
%
% ROOT EXPORTS. The order's result atoms, its forty-two profile key atoms, its
% thirty-eight duty atoms and the judgement value unsure are read by the scorer
% as package-root attributes: each is defined below as a plain fact of arity 0
% and exported, so the generated facade carries it. The result CONSTRUCTORS
% (required/1, outstanding/1, indeterminate/1, needs_legal_review/2,
% open_textured/2, inputs_relied_on/1, provenance/2, input_problems/1,
% unknown_key/1, wrong_type/1, duplicate_key/1) are data: they are exported
% and declared as constructors, and have no clauses.
% =====================================================================

